{"4341210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shaka Tamers", "steam_appid": 4341210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acquire</strong>, <strong>raise</strong> and <strong>level-up</strong> your <strong>Shaka</strong>. Uncover your familiy's <strong>past</strong> to create a brighter <strong>future</strong>. Gather resources and cook powerfull meals. Find <strong>mythical guardians </strong>and unlock the dark lord's liar to finally end their<strong> reign of chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/8cb52150a0f5ea9f4a6f8093ba470529.avif?t=1781805136\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras_big/8cb52150a0f5ea9f4a6f8093ba470529.webp?t=1781805136 width=1560 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Long ago there were Tamers, people able to harness power of uncorrupted Shaka to protect world from the Dark Lord's influence. When the <strong>First Cataclysm</strong> devastated the land, the Tamer Clan was founded, Its members sealed away the ancient evil and brought an age of peace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After Thousands of years many said the Cataclysm never really happened. They've said Dark Lord was only a story told to children. Then the second one finally came.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/9836a87e4bf5c1efa8dd5b06d7673df7.poster.avif?t=1781805136\" width=616 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/9836a87e4bf5c1efa8dd5b06d7673df7.webm?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/9836a87e4bf5c1efa8dd5b06d7673df7.mp4?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Overworld</strong>, search for unique materials, defeat Elite enemies and learn truth by finding hidden relics scoured around the map. <strong>Customize your playstyle</strong>, mix and match weapons and passives to suit your needs. Are you a tanky wall or a cunning sniper? Either way we've got you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fa72a94211ed68647afeae0ada21987f.poster.avif?t=1781805136\" width=616 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fa72a94211ed68647afeae0ada21987f.webm?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fa72a94211ed68647afeae0ada21987f.mp4?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand</strong> your rooster of <strong>Shaka</strong>, level them up to aquire more power and abilities. Each Shaka enhances Hiro in unique ways, allowing him to take on increasingly dangerous foes. Choose wisely though, there is limited amount of Shaka you can take with you, so make every one of them count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fcaef1f24e0b219ad13dcd88995e77e7.poster.avif?t=1781805136\" width=616 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fcaef1f24e0b219ad13dcd88995e77e7.webm?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fcaef1f24e0b219ad13dcd88995e77e7.mp4?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is not just about fighting, during your adventures you'll <strong>collect</strong> lot's of <strong>resourcess</strong> you can use to <strong>cook meals</strong> for your <strong>Shaka</strong>. Small meals can boost them for a single run. Each Shaka have their preferences and will require their favourite meals to <strong>level up</strong>. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acquire</strong>, <strong>raise</strong> and <strong>level-up</strong> your <strong>Shaka</strong>. Uncover your familiy's <strong>past</strong> to create a brighter <strong>future</strong>. Gather resources and cook powerfull meals. Find <strong>mythical guardians </strong>and unlock the dark lord's liar to finally end their<strong> reign of chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/8cb52150a0f5ea9f4a6f8093ba470529.avif?t=1781805136\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras_big/8cb52150a0f5ea9f4a6f8093ba470529.webp?t=1781805136 width=1560 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Long ago there were Tamers, people able to harness power of uncorrupted Shaka to protect world from the Dark Lord's influence. When the <strong>First Cataclysm</strong> devastated the land, the Tamer Clan was founded, Its members sealed away the ancient evil and brought an age of peace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After Thousands of years many said the Cataclysm never really happened. They've said Dark Lord was only a story told to children. Then the second one finally came.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/9836a87e4bf5c1efa8dd5b06d7673df7.poster.avif?t=1781805136\" width=616 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/9836a87e4bf5c1efa8dd5b06d7673df7.webm?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/9836a87e4bf5c1efa8dd5b06d7673df7.mp4?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Overworld</strong>, search for unique materials, defeat Elite enemies and learn truth by finding hidden relics scoured around the map. <strong>Customize your playstyle</strong>, mix and match weapons and passives to suit your needs. Are you a tanky wall or a cunning sniper? Either way we've got you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fa72a94211ed68647afeae0ada21987f.poster.avif?t=1781805136\" width=616 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fa72a94211ed68647afeae0ada21987f.webm?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fa72a94211ed68647afeae0ada21987f.mp4?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand</strong> your rooster of <strong>Shaka</strong>, level them up to aquire more power and abilities. Each Shaka enhances Hiro in unique ways, allowing him to take on increasingly dangerous foes. Choose wisely though, there is limited amount of Shaka you can take with you, so make every one of them count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fcaef1f24e0b219ad13dcd88995e77e7.poster.avif?t=1781805136\" width=616 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fcaef1f24e0b219ad13dcd88995e77e7.webm?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/extras/fcaef1f24e0b219ad13dcd88995e77e7.mp4?t=1781805136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is not just about fighting, during your adventures you'll <strong>collect</strong> lot's of <strong>resourcess</strong> you can use to <strong>cook meals</strong> for your <strong>Shaka</strong>. Small meals can boost them for a single run. Each Shaka have their preferences and will require their favourite meals to <strong>level up</strong>. </p>", "short_description": "Shaka Tamers is a mix of Action RPG, Creature Collector and Bullet Hell. Explore the world, discover new biomes, fight bosses, tame and level up your Shakas. Help Hiro on his journey to reclaim his clan's lost legacy by defeating the corruption of Emel.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/06fbd58a2f8535ad8e710c0d4f62e031d598e3e2/header.jpg?t=1781805136", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/4ec646bceddf069c483ac4f4c7350052e8030d98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781805136", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341210/